<title>USA: Molecular Biosystems names Venkatadri CEO.</title>
<headline>Molecular Biosystems names Venkatadri CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Molecular Biosystems Inc said Wednesday it named Bobba Venkatadri chief executive.</p>
<p>The company said Venkatadri is currently president and chief operating office, and will keep those jobs along with the chief executive officer job.</p>
<p>The company said Venkatadri will replace Kenneth Widder, who will remain chairman of the board.</p>
<p>The company said these changes are the result of its previously adopted plan of management succession.</p>
